  - RNA-seq
repository-code: "https://github.com/aojielian/asd_microexon_prioritization"
# Companion Zenodo data package DOI: 10.5281/zenodo.21928557
abstract: >
  Analysis code for perturbation-guided prioritization of autism-associated
  microexon splicing events: CHyMErA perturbation-defined event definition,
  mouse-to-human cortical mapping, set-level autism enrichment, developmental
  and directional context, PsychENCODE mixed-model analysis, robustness,
  cell-composition and transcript-definition sensitivity, and protein-context
  prioritization. Companion derived analysis data are released in a Zenodo
  data package.
